<title>SWEDEN: Gambro to spend 6-7 bln skr on buys.</title>
<headline>Gambro to spend 6-7 bln skr on buys.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish medical technology company Gambro, wholly owned by Swedish investment company Incentive AB, said on Thursday it planned to spend six to seven billion crowns on acqusitions over the next four years.</p>
</text>
